      "bounds": {
        "top": 0,
        "left": 912,
        "width": 912,
        "height": 228
      },
      "tileFilter": {},
      "markdown": {
        "content": "### Thresholds\n- IteratorAge warn **> 60,000 ms**, crit **> 300,000 ms**\n- Firehose Success% warn **< 99%**, crit **< 95%**\n- Silent account: **no ingress 30m** (active in last 7d)\n\n### Links\nKinesis \u2022 Lambda \u2022 Firehose \u2022 Splunk HF"
